\f6\b\fs36 \cf0 2.1 Context model\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa80\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs32 \cf0 At runtime, you maintain:\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f12\fs28 \cf0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf0 \cb13 context: \cf18 dict\cf0 [\cf18 str\cf0 , \cf14 Any\cf0 ] = \{\}\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa80\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs32 \cf0 \cb1 Rules:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls337\ilvl0\cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Keys in 
\f8\fs28 \cb12 context
\f0\fs32 \cb1  correspond to 
\f8\fs28 \cb12 inputs
\f0\fs32 \cb1  / 
\f8\fs28 \cb12 outputs
\f0\fs32 \cb1  names in 
\f8\fs28 \cb12 ExecutionGraphStep
\f0\fs32 \cb1 .\
\ls337\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Every step reads all its 
\f8\fs28 \cb12 inputs
\f0\fs32 \cb1  from 
\f8\fs28 \cb12 context
\f0\fs32 \cb1  (must exist, or you error).\
\ls337\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
Every step writes its 
\f8\fs28 \cb12 outputs
\f0\fs32 \cb1  into 
\f8\fs28 \cb12 context
\f0\fs32 \cb1 , overwriting if necessary (v1).\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa80\partightenfactor0
\cf0 Examples of context keys:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls338\ilvl0
\f8\fs28 \cf0 \cb12 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
"user_input"
\f0\fs32 \cb1  
\f7 \uc0\u8594 
\f0  Input object from caller.\
\ls338\ilvl0
\f8\fs28 \cb12 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
"task_spec"
\f0\fs32 \cb1  
\f7 \uc0\u8594 
\f0  normalized representation of input.\
\ls338\ilvl0
\f8\fs28 \cb12 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
"agent_outputs"
\f0\fs32 \cb1  
\f7 \uc0\u8594 
\f0  list of Output-ish objects.\
\ls338\ilvl0
\f8\fs28 \cb12 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
"disagreement"
\f0\fs32 \cb1  
\f7 \uc0\u8594 
\f0  Disagreement object.\
\ls338\ilvl0
\f8\fs28 \cb12 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
"episode"
\f0\fs32 \cb1  
\f7 \uc0\u8594 
\f0  built Episode object.\
\ls338\ilvl0
\f8\fs28 \cb12 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
"episode_id"
