\f6\b\fs36 \cf0 4.1 Dataset extraction view\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa80\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs32 \cf0 From GhostLink\'92s perspective, the training pipeline sees Episodes as input rows.\
